        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Reverse a Clip\n\nPlays a video backwards. Use it for loop-and-return transitions where the return leg is the same footage reversed. It runs locally through ffmpeg with no API key or per-run cost.\n\n**How it works:** \"Clip\" takes your video. \"Reverse\" flips the frame order, and \"Result\" returns the reversed clip.\n\n**Try this:** Run a short camera push-in through it and cut the reversed copy after the original to get a push-in and pull-out loop."
        },
